{title: A New Covenant}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
I will bring a new covenant, says the Lord,
With My people, yes, with My people,
Not as the first one that I made
When I delivered them out of bondage,
When I led My people to the Promised Land.

Verse 2
For the covenant made between us, says the Lord,
With My people, yes, with My people,
Has been broken by rebellion
Tho' to them I was a Husband,
Tho' I delivered them with a sure and mighty Hand.

Refrain
This shall I do, this now I say:
I shall write upon their hearts a brand new Promise.
They shall abide in this new and glorious Way,
With I their God,
And they My people.

Verse 3
(Instrumental; repeat refrain; at end add...)
With I their God,
And they My people!
